  nonce: 6b5e  # 6b5e
  message: "Fixed in PR #3388 (commit 92914326a). Added _AUTOLOAD_BY_CONVENTION_FRAMEWORKS exemption frozenset in profile.py; refine_frameworks now keeps Rails in profile.frameworks based on Gemfile detection alone, even when the import-edge confirmation check would have demoted it. Three new tests cover the Rails autoload case, the zero-edges degenerate case, and the Sinatra counter-test (which IS imported and stays subject to demotion). 100% coverage; full smart-test suite passed (16,168 tests). The expected downstream effect is that chatwoot's next bakeoff cohort shows non-empty 'controller'/'route'/'form'/'serializer' concept tags from rails.yaml — to be validated by the WI-gokop/WI-gudob mini-cohort being run next."  # 6b5e
